## Integration acceptance

- Check decimal-comma and decimal-point formats, 12/24-hour display and local/server-zone choices with identical underlying readings.
- Test the repeated hour on 25 October 2026 in Europe/London and an all-day due date without shifting it.
- Inspect long and right-to-left text, while recording language-review limits and keeping copied IDs exact.

Record actual environment, versions, state, method and result using the [native task accessibility matrix](native-task-accessibility.html). Source review and a local example do not establish physical execution, screen-reader usability or live compatibility.

